# Manual API checks. Needs the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above each block. Requests are separated by ###.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Shorten: valid
POST {{base}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longURL": "https://example.com/some/long/path" }

### Shorten: missing longURL → 400
POST {{base}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Shorten: wrong type → 400
POST {{base}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{ "longURL": 123 }

### Shorten: malformed JSON → 400 (error handler)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{bad

### Redirect: found → 302
# @no-redirect
GET {{base}}/zFp3eW

### Redirect: unknown → 404
GET {{base}}/missing

### Stat: found
GET {{base}}/api/v1/zFp3eW/stat

### Stat: unknown → 404
GET {{base}}/api/v1/missing/stat
